---
description: When to run scribe recall (inherits AGENTS.md session path)
alwaysApply: true
---

For a team decision, active Dream or SPEC, or a Herald fact-ledger number,
run `pixi run -e pyforge-guild scribe recall "…" --mode planning` — do
not guess from chat memory. Default omits `kind=code`. Marshal
`codegraph` (`.codegraph/codegraph.db`) owns symbol navigation. Do not
use `scribe recall --mode code` for symbols. Full contract:
`AGENTS.md` § *Scribe recall (session path)*.
